<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκμ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>moisture</i>, e.g. of oily leather, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.392
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰκμάδος ἐστὶ ἐν αὐτῇ [τῇ Λιβύῃ]
					οὐδέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.185
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνιεὶς ἐκ τοῦ σώματος
			ἰκμάδα</span>, of a corpse exposed to the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.125
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				8
			</span></i>; of <i>moisture</i> in the soil, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				8.6
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θανόντων ἰσὶν οὐκ ἔνεστ᾽
				ἰκμάς</span> no <i>blood</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				229
			</span></i> (prob.); of the bodily <i>humours</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				4.40
			</span></i>; of all kinds of <i>animal juices</i> or <i>moist
				secretions</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ περίττωμα τῆς ὑγρᾶς ἰ. ὃν
					καλοῦμεν ἱδρῶτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					668b4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τῶν καταμηνίων ἰ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>GA</u>
				727b11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>HA</u>
				556b27
			</span></i>, al.: com. metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ἰ. τῆς φροντίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					233
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. Βάκχου</span>, i.e. wine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.133
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰ. δρυός</span>, i.e. gum,
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.109
			</span></i> (Antip.).</div>
